<div id="S2.SS6.SSS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">We define the map</span></p>
