<p id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">Suppose that <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(s^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(s^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(R/I)\#\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(R/I)\#\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>. Then <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=0</annotation></semantics></math> and hence <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)}\in I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)}\in I</annotation></semantics></math>, for any <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma\in\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma\in\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows that <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)})p_{\gamma}\in I\#\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}-s^{(\gamma)})p_{\gamma}\in I\#\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> and hence <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma=\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}s^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma=\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}s^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is well-defined. Clearly <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is a surjective <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝗄</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{k}</annotation></semantics></math>-algebra homomorphism. It remains to show <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is injective. Suppose that <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma})=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma})=0</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e., <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}+I\#\Gamma=0</annotation></semantics></math>. Then <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}\in I\#\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}r^{(\gamma)}p_{\gamma}\in I\#\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> and hence <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{(\gamma)}\in I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{(\gamma)}\in I</annotation></semantics></math> for any <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma\in\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma\in\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum\limits_{\gamma\in\Gamma}(r^{(\gamma)}+I)p_{\gamma}=0</annotation></semantics></math> and thus <math id="S2.SS6.SSS2.p2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> is injective.
∎</span></p>
