<div id="S5.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S5.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">For the idempotent map <math id="S5.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e:F\xrightarrow{}F" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mover accent="true"><mo>→</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mover><mi>F</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e:F\xrightarrow{}F</annotation></semantics></math>, it is a fact that</span></p>
