<p id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Here, we have <math id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{0}=(-)_{0}(f)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">−</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{0}=(-)_{0}(f)</annotation></semantics></math>. Furthermore, the zeroth component of the <math id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>-graded <math id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝗄</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{k}</annotation></semantics></math>-algebra <math id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\langle\overline{f}=0\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\langle\overline{f}=0\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> is isomorphic to <math id="S5.Thmthm6.p1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{0}\langle\overline{f_{0}}=0\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{0}\langle\overline{f_{0}}=0\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
