</table>
<p id="S5.SS4.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS4.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">is the graded <math id="S5.SS4.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\text{-}\text{ring}_{\mathsf{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mtext>-</mtext><mtext>ring</mtext></mrow><mi>𝗄</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\text{-}\text{ring}_{\mathsf{k}}</annotation></semantics></math> with a universal family of graded module homomorphisms</span></p>
