<p id="S5.SS4.p11.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS4.p11.2.1" class="ltx_text">such that <math id="S5.SS4.p11.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{2}^{T}\circ\theta_{1}=\eta\circ\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{2}^{T}\circ\theta_{1}=\eta\circ\theta</annotation></semantics></math>. The proof is completed.
∎</span></p>
