<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.SS1.p13.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(yd^{(\gamma)})_{j}=\sum_{i\in J}y_{i}d^{(\gamma)}_{ij}=\sum_{i\in J}(\sum_{\alpha\in\Gamma}y_{i,\alpha}p_{\alpha})d_{ij}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}}=\sum_{i\in J}\sum_{\alpha\in\Gamma}y_{i,\alpha}(d_{ij})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{j}}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}}=\sum_{i\in J}y_{i,\gamma-\beta_{i}}d_{ij}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable displaystyle="true"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(yd^{(\gamma)})_{j}=\sum_{i\in J}y_{i}d^{(\gamma)}_{ij}=\sum_{i\in J}(\sum_{\alpha\in\Gamma}y_{i,\alpha}p_{\alpha})d_{ij}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}}=\sum_{i\in J}\sum_{\alpha\in\Gamma}y_{i,\alpha}(d_{ij})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{j}}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}}=\sum_{i\in J}y_{i,\gamma-\beta_{i}}d_{ij}p_{\gamma-\beta_{j}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.SS1.p13.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p13.3.1" class="ltx_text">since <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\deg(d_{ij})=\beta_{j}-\beta_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\deg(d_{ij})=\beta_{j}-\beta_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence we may assume that <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i,\alpha}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i,\alpha}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, for any <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in J" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in J</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\neq\gamma-\beta_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\neq\gamma-\beta_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. Define <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">∈</mo><mrow><msub><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}=y_{j,\gamma-\beta_{j}}~(j\in J)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}=y_{j,\gamma-\beta_{j}}~(j\in J)</annotation></semantics></math>. Then clearly <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y=x^{(\gamma)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y=x^{(\gamma)}</annotation></semantics></math> and hence <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z=yd^{(\gamma)}=x^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=\theta(xd)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=yd^{(\gamma)}=x^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=\theta(xd)</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus <math id="S6.SS1.p13.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> is surjective.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S6.SS1.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS1.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">It remains to show that <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> is a module homomorphism. Clearly</span></p>
<table id="S6.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta(xd+yd)=\theta((x+y)d)=(x+y)^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=x^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}+y^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=\theta(xd)+\theta(yd)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta(xd+yd)=\theta((x+y)d)=(x+y)^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=x^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}+y^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}=\theta(xd)+\theta(yd),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6.8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.SS1.p14.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p14.2.1" class="ltx_text">for any <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x,y\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">∈</mo><mrow><msub><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x,y\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>. Let now <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">∈</mo><mrow><msub><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in R</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\in\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\in\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>. Then</span></p>
<table id="S6.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.E9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\theta(rp_{\alpha}.xd)=\theta(r(xd)_{\alpha})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta(rp_{\alpha}.xd)=\theta(r(xd)_{\alpha}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6.9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.SS1.p14.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p14.3.1" class="ltx_text">For any <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in J" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in J</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
<table id="S6.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="((xd)_{\alpha})_{j}=((xd)_{j})_{\alpha}=\Big(\sum_{i\in J}x_{i}d_{ij}\Big)_{\alpha}=\sum_{i\in J}(x_{i})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{i}}d_{ij}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">((xd)_{\alpha})_{j}=((xd)_{j})_{\alpha}=\Big(\sum_{i\in J}x_{i}d_{ij}\Big)_{\alpha}=\sum_{i\in J}(x_{i})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{i}}d_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6.10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.SS1.p14.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p14.4.1" class="ltx_text">since <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\deg((x_{i})_{\delta}d_{ij})=\delta-\beta(i)+\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>δ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\deg((x_{i})_{\delta}d_{ij})=\delta-\beta(i)+\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R(\beta(j)-\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R(\beta(j)-\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>. Define <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">∈</mo><mrow><msub><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y\in\bigoplus_{j\in J}R(\beta_{j})</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="S6.SS1.p14.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{j}=r(x_{j})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{j}}~(j\in J)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{j}=r(x_{j})_{\alpha-\gamma+\beta_{j}}~(j\in J)</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows from (<a href="#S6.E9" title="In Proof. ‣ 6.1. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras I ‣ 6. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras ‣ Bergman algebrasThe graded universal algebra constructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.9</span></a>) and (<a href="#S6.E10" title="In Proof. ‣ 6.1. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras I ‣ 6. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras ‣ Bergman algebrasThe graded universal algebra constructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.10</span></a>) that</span></p>
<table id="S6.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S6.E11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\theta(rp_{\alpha}.xd)=\theta(yd)=y^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta(rp_{\alpha}.xd)=\theta(yd)=y^{(\gamma)}d^{(\gamma)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6.11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S6.SS1.p14.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p14.5.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand we have</span></p>
