<p id="S6.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A\subseteq\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A\subseteq\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> a finite subset. We denote by <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\#\Gamma_{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\#\Gamma_{A}</annotation></semantics></math> the subalgebra of <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\#\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\#\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> consisting of all sums of elements <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="rp_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">rp_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\in R_{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\in R_{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha+\beta,\beta\in\Gamma_{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha+\beta,\beta\in\Gamma_{A}</annotation></semantics></math>. Note that <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\#\Gamma_{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>#</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\#\Gamma_{A}</annotation></semantics></math> is is a unital algebra with identity <math id="S6.SS2.p5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{\gamma\in\Gamma_{A}}p_{\gamma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{\gamma\in\Gamma_{A}}p_{\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
