<p id="S7.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[P]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[P]</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the isomorphism class of <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>P</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math> as a graded <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>-module. <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}^{\operatorname{gr}}(R)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mi>gr</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}^{\operatorname{gr}}(R)</annotation></semantics></math> becomes a <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>-monoid by defining <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[P]+[Q]=[P\oplus Q]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[P]+[Q]=[P\oplus Q]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S7.SS1.p2.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma.[P]=[P(\gamma)]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma.[P]=[P(\gamma)]</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
