<p id="S7.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">See the proof of Lemma <a href="#S6.Thmthm5" title="Lemma 6.5. ‣ 6.1. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras I ‣ 6. Smash products of graded Bergman algebras ‣ Bergman algebrasThe graded universal algebra constructions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6.5</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
