<div id="S7.Thmthm5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_thm">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S7.Thmthm5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem 7.5</span></span><span id="S7.Thmthm5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S7.Thmthm5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.Thmthm5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.Thmthm5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">There is a monoid isomorphism</span></p>
