athcal{V}^{\operatorname{gr}}(S)\cong\mathcal{V}^{\operatorname{gr}}(R)\Big\langle[P_{1}^{(\gamma)}],[P_{2}^{(\gamma)}]~(\gamma\in A)\mid[P(\gamma)]=[P_{1}^{(\gamma)}]+[P_{2}^{(\gamma)}]~(\gamma\in\Gamma)\Big\rangle,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
